## 4. Component Hierarchy & Provider Stack

```mermaid
graph TD
    A["DynamicModelTable<br/>(forwardRef, entry point)"] --> B["MetadataProvider<br/>key={app:model}"]
    B --> C["TableProvider<br/>(initialState: density, pagination,<br/>filters, advancedFilters)"]
    C --> D["DynamicBaseTableContent<br/>(main orchestrator)"]
    D --> E["DynamicTable<br/>(TanStack-powered grid)"]
