```

### `DynamicModelTable` (Outer Wrapper)

- Receives `app`, `model`, `initVariables`, config props
- Normalizes initial state via [resolveInitialTableState()](file:///e:/Projects/libraries/rail-react/src/widgets/model-table/components/DynamicModelTable.tsx#L264-L315):
  - Extracts `page`, `perPage` from init variables
  - Normalizes `presets`, `distinctOn`, `orderBy`
  - Creates initial advanced filter state
- Exposes **imperative handle** (`DynamicModelTableHandle`) with:
  - [refetch()](file:///e:/Projects/libraries/rail-react/src/widgets/model-table/components/DynamicModelTable.tsx#1328-1334), [getSnapshot()](file:///e:/Projects/libraries/rail-react/src/widgets/model-table/components/DynamicModelTable.tsx#1312-1313), [data](file:///e:/Projects/libraries/rail-react/src/widgets/model-table/components/DynamicModelTable.tsx#1313-1316), [selectedRows](file:///e:/Projects/libraries/rail-react/src/widgets/model-table/components/DynamicModelTable.tsx#1338-1341), [loading](file:///e:/Projects/libraries/rail-react/src/widgets/model-table/components/DynamicModelTable.tsx#1322-1325), etc.

### [DynamicBaseTableContent](file:///e:/Projects/libraries/rail-react/src/widgets/model-table/components/DynamicModelTable.tsx#426-1265) (Inner Orchestrator)

This is the 800+ line core logic at [line 429](file:///e:/Projects/libraries/rail-react/src/widgets/model-table/components/DynamicModelTable.tsx#L429-L1264). It orchestrates everything:

